ead-only, as","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the contract requires — ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/now","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" derives the time from the move counter","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and writes nothing.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"It derives it from the counter ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"as the turn closed","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":", because that is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"where the engine samples a contributed field: the same reading the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"turn’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".time"},{"text":" action, its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"describe"},{"text":" blocks, and the alarms and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scheduled moves in its timer phase all took. Until #280 the field was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"read one increment later, so every cost turn’s footer stood one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GnustoClock\/documentation\/GnustoClock\/Clock\/minutesPerTurn","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ahead of every hour the game itself had just","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"printed — and because a free turn advances no counter, the offset was","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"not constant and so could not be corrected by habit. Nothing here","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"changed to fix it; the sampling point did.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"The hour, for the play-test status footer — ","type":"text"},{"code":"time=5:46 pm","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"GnustoClock"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"prop